        <groundspeak:log id="1207548834">
          <groundspeak:date>2023-12-03T00:54:00Z</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="7372333">wilfredowitz</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="False">*Dear geo2cat - I also found your cache*

I think it's a wonderful experience to travel around and find caches. One of the things that makes the joy great - is that I get to see places I never dreamed existed. I get to read new stories about all sorts of fun experiences &amp; backgrounds for just the individual caches.

Now it's my day number 6 in Iasi. Fantastic start on the day - with great T5 events in the forrest - and lots of fun and cooperations with nice people from Romania, Moldova and Denmark. Great time - and thank you for the great weather during the day.

In the afternoon, one of the great person from Iasi (Marasileo) took me around in the town, to find some super-great caches. Thanks for this great experiences - and nice day together.

Evening ended with a nice events at the home of Mr. Event-host, RaduC. Great great great evening - with lots of atmosphere.
- and one more day with a Firstfinders

Any comments about this particular cache: *This cache is excellent in its fine hiding*
I found it on oure week trip to Iasi, where we take part in many events and have fun with geocaching.
Its great to visit the hosts, RaduC and Florina18 - and traveling with 29kenneth, Flemmar, L+K and Karimdk - all from Denmark
Mostly caches is logged with our team-stamp "GTF" (Geo Team Freaks) or my own nickname (Wilfredowitz)

I also note that there are many who do a great job out of their caches - occasionally I find myself rewarding these with a FP.
Lets me just say - lots of FP to great caches in this town !!!

*Many thanks for the cache, geo2cat, - and thanks for taking the time to save caches for the rest of us*</groundspeak:text>
